102 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 47 0 R
/T (The major business issue is that the guest house has no clear view of how its occupancy and revenue change over the year. Every guest is a walk-in, the busiest periods are the festive and winter seasons, and bookings are noted only in small handwritten notebooks. As a result, rooms may stay empty in lean months, the tariffs of Rs. 1,200 for an AC room and Rs. 800 for a non- AC room may not suit every season, and the records cannot yet show which rooms and guests earn the most.)
/E (The major business issue is that the guest house has no clear view of how its occupancy and revenue change over the year. Every guest is a walk-in, the busiest periods are the festive and winter seasons, and bookings are noted only in small handwritten notebooks. As a result, rooms may stay empty in lean months, the tariffs of Rs. 1,200 for an AC room and Rs. 800 for a non- AC room may not suit every season, and the records cannot yet show which rooms and guests earn the most.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
103 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 47 0 R
/T (The issues will be addressed by collecting primary data from the guest house's own notebook records and analysing it with descriptive statistics, trend analysis and revenue analysis, using Excel and Python. The expected outcome is a set of practical recommendations that help the guest house fill more rooms in lean months, set tariffs on evidence and keep better records. The project cannot solve every problem of the business, but it will enable the guest house to identify its bottlenecks and tackle a few of them..)
/E (The issues will be addressed by collecting primary data from the guest house's own notebook records and analysing it with descriptive statistics, trend analysis and revenue analysis, using Excel and Python. The expected outcome is a set of practical recommendations that help the guest house fill more rooms in lean months, set tariffs on evidence and keep better records. The project cannot solve every problem of the business, but it will enable the guest house to identify its bottlenecks and tackle a few of them..)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [14]
>>
