/T (A guest house earns money only when its rooms are occupied, and a room left empty on a given night cannot be sold again for that night. If all seven rooms were occupied, the guest house would earn Rs. 6,800 a night, from three AC rooms at Rs. 1,200 and four non-AC rooms at Rs. 800, so every empty room matters. The problems listed above arise from a mix of internal and external causes.)
/E (A guest house earns money only when its rooms are occupied, and a room left empty on a given night cannot be sold again for that night. If all seven rooms were occupied, the guest house would earn Rs. 6,800 a night, from three AC rooms at Rs. 1,200 and four non-AC rooms at Rs. 800, so every empty room matters. The problems listed above arise from a mix of internal and external causes.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
112 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 48 0 R
/T (Internal causes. Bookings are recorded informally in small handwritten notebooks, which makes it hard to total monthly revenue or compare one month with another. With only three staff members, of whom one is the receptionist, there may be little time to maintain detailed records. The guest house also takes no online bookings, so every guest has to walk in. External causes. Tourism in Jodhpur is seasonal, with the busiest periods in the festive and winter seasons and quieter months in between. Many hotels and guest houses near the bus stand and the railway station compete for the same travellers, and many travellers now compare options and book rooms online, which a walk-in-only guest house may miss.)
/E (Internal causes. Bookings are recorded informally in small handwritten notebooks, which makes it hard to total monthly revenue or compare one month with another. With only three staff members, of whom one is the receptionist, there may be little time to maintain detailed records. The guest house also takes no online bookings, so every guest has to walk in. External causes. Tourism in Jodhpur is seasonal, with the busiest periods in the festive and winter seasons and quieter months in between. Many hotels and guest houses near the bus stand and the railway station compete for the same travellers, and many travellers now compare options and book rooms online, which a walk-in-only guest house may miss.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
113 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 48 0 R
/T (These causes work together, because seasonal swings expose the lack of records and the dependence on walk-ins leaves little room to plan ahead. The project will therefore study how these problems appear in the guest house's own data and which of them can be reduced.)
/E (These causes work together, because seasonal swings expose the lack of records and the dependence on walk-ins leaves little room to plan ahead. The project will therefore study how these problems appear in the guest house's own data and which of them can be reduced.)
