/T (Excel will be used for data entry, quick checks and pivot tables, because the owner can open and understand it easily. Python, with pandas and matplotlib, will be used for cleaning, grouping, descriptive statistics and charts, because it handles large records quickly and makes the work repeatable. Cleaning will remove duplicates, fix date and tariff errors, and flag missing values, and the cleaned data will be cross-checked against the owner's bills. Descriptive statistics such as the mean, median and range will summarise occupancy and tariffs, and correlation will test the link between tariff and occupancy. Every chart will have a title, labelled axes and a stated reason for the chosen chart type.)
/E (Excel will be used for data entry, quick checks and pivot tables, because the owner can open and understand it easily. Python, with pandas and matplotlib, will be used for cleaning, grouping, descriptive statistics and charts, because it handles large records quickly and makes the work repeatable. Cleaning will remove duplicates, fix date and tariff errors, and flag missing values, and the cleaned data will be cross-checked against the owner's bills. Descriptive statistics such as the mean, median and range will summarise occupancy and tariffs, and correlation will test the link between tariff and occupancy. Every chart will have a title, labelled axes and a stated reason for the chosen chart type.)
