/Title (The issues will be addressed by collecting primary data from the guest house's own notebook records and analysing it with descriptive statistics, trend analysis and revenue analysis, using Excel and Python. The expected outcome is a set of practical recommendations that help the guest house fill more rooms in lean months, set tariffs on evidence and keep better records. The project cannot solve every problem of the business, but it will enable the guest house to identify its bottlenecks and tackle a few of them..)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 324 0 R
/Prev 409 0 R
>>
