/Title (The project focuses on Marwar Guest House, a family-run guest house on the ground floor of a family home opposite Hotel Royal Inn on Paota A Road, near the New Bus Stand in Jodhpur. Owned by Mr. Mahipal Singh and operating since 2022, it offers seven rooms to travellers, and the business is B2C.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 324 0 R
/Prev 376 0 R
/Next 409 0 R
>>
