409 0 obj
<<
/Title (The major business issue is that the guest house has no clear view of how its occupancy and revenue change over the year. Every guest is a walk-in, the busiest periods are the festive and winter seasons, and bookings are noted only in small handwritten notebooks. As a result, rooms may stay empty in lean months, the tariffs of Rs. 1,200 for an AC room and Rs. 800 for a non- AC room may not suit every season, and the records cannot yet show which rooms and guests earn the most.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 324 0 R
/Prev 408 0 R
/Next 377 0 R
>>
endobj
410 0 obj
<<
/Title (Marwar Guest House is a family-runguesthouse in Jodhpur, Rajasthan, owned by Mr. Mahipal Singh)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 378 0 R
/Next 411 0 R
>>
