411 0 obj
<<
/Title (and operating since 2022. It is located opposite Hotel Royal Inn on Paota A Road, near the New Bus Stand. The guest house occupies the ground floor of the family home, which the family renovated with an investment of about Rs. 20 lakh so that it could be used for renting out rooms. It has seven rooms, of which three are air-conditioned at Rs. 1,200 per night and four are non-air-conditioned at Rs. 800 per night, and it also provides Wi-Fi and parking. Three staff members work at the guest house, two for cleaning and housekeeping and one as the receptionist. Most guests are travellers who choose it because the bus stand and the railway station are close by, and all of them check in in person, since there is no online booking. The business is therefore B2C, and its busiest periods are the festive and winter seasons. Jodhpur, known as the Blue City, attracts many visitors to Mehrangarh Fort and other heritage sites.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 378 0 R
/Prev 410 0 R
>>
endobj
412 0 obj
<<
